 1331 f811:             ; VB aaaa bb bb ..: bytes stored from aaaa on, to CR/LF; aaaa must be in VIDRAM's 4K block and the bytes stop at its
 1332 f811:             ; end (never the ROM). $D800-$DFFF is the V2.0 card's graphics window (the plane and page OUT PC chose)
